; Akari WinCE API surface — public imports for fwapi.dll (X86).
; Names and ordinals were recorded from a CE 6.0 export survey.
; Non-import-library exports are omitted. This text is original.
LIBRARY fwapi.dll
EXPORTS
  FirewallCreateRule
  FirewallDeleteRule
  FirewallEnableRule
  FirewallGetRules
  FirewallEnable
  IsFirewallEnabled
  FirewallRefresh
  FirewallSetInterface
  IsInterfaceFirewalled
